# Etali, Primal Conqueror: a spell can only be cast as the ability resolves if it could be (CR 608.2g, 601.2): a
# Counterspell needs a spell to target, and there is none on the stack, so the Counterspells found on top of both libraries
# are not offered and stay in exile. The default answer to an offer is to take the first card, so a Counterspell
# offered would be cast, fail and show; here the Etali's controller is asked nothing and both stay exiled. (The
# neighbouring scenario with a Lightning Bolt found beside it is the positive control.)

